  <!-- Helmet section (Source/1.6/Settings/Settings_Helmet.cs). {0} in every tooltip is the default -->
  <!-- EN: Helmet -->
  <HPWC_SectionHelmet>헬멧</HPWC_SectionHelmet>
  <!-- EN: The sealed visor of the hemophage warcasket helmet keeps sunlight off a pilot who is sensitive to it and steadies a pilot who is afraid of fire. -->
  <HPWC_SectionHelmetDesc>헤모파지 워캐스킷 헬멧의 밀폐형 바이저는 햇빛에 민감한 조종사를 햇빛으로부터 지켜 주고, 불을 두려워하는 조종사를 진정시켜 줍니다.</HPWC_SectionHelmetDesc>
  <!-- EN: Sunlight protection -->
  <HPWC_HelmetSunlight>햇빛 차단</HPWC_HelmetSunlight>
  <!-- EN: When enabled, the helmet will protect a pilot with a UV sensitivity gene from the effects of sunlight. When disabled, sunlight will slow such a pilot and lower their mood as usual. Default: {0}. -->
  <HPWC_HelmetSunlightDesc>켜면 헬멧이 자외선 민감성 유전자가 있는 조종사를 햇빛의 영향으로부터 보호합니다. 끄면 그런 조종사는 평소처럼 햇빛을 받으면 느려지고 기분이 나빠집니다. 기본값: {0}.</HPWC_HelmetSunlightDesc>
  <!-- EN: Fire terror chance -->
  <HPWC_HelmetPyrophobia>불에서 도망칠 확률</HPWC_HelmetPyrophobia>
  <!-- EN: How often a pilot with the pyrophobia gene will flee in terror from a nearby fire, compared to normal. At 0%, the pilot will never flee from fire. Default: {0}. -->
